# ilostat

Python tools for accessing and working with ILOSTAT data.

## Planned API

```python
import ilostat

df = ilostat.get_df("UNE_TUNE_SEX_AGE_NB_A")
toc = ilostat.get_toc()
dic = ilostat.get_dic("sex")
